#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:1
#: d0c5408468cf4e53bcae3d550b638228
msgid "数据分布（Explore distributions）"
msgstr "Explore distributions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:3
#: c32103d412114f35802ea1dc7fd5e1b1
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:5
#: fe0308231e5a43888255c624027694fa
msgid "在统一的训练集评估页面中查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差分布，并从分箱反向选择结构。 适合先看整体长尾，再追到对应结构，而不是逐帧浏览。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect energy, force, virial, prediction, or error distributions on the "
"unified Training Set Audit page, and select structures back from "
"histogram bins. This supports reviewing the overall tails first and then "
"tracing them to structures instead of browsing frame by frame."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:8
#: 43a5839271e24840bf826f4944a2e27a
msgid "可选字段与联动"
msgstr "Fields and Linked Selection"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8421
#: 3e3b63534c8a4db08f556453481db319
msgid "入口：点击工具栏 `训练集评估`，再切到「数据地图 → 数据分布」。工具栏不再单独提供分布按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Entry: click `Training Set Audit` on the toolbar, then switch to `Data "
"map → Explore distributions`. The toolbar no longer has a separate "
"distribution button."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8422
#: f794f20618484f25b20a928d16d7e4ed
msgid "默认只需要选择 `字段 / 数值类型 / 分组方式 / 数据范围`。"
msgstr "By default, choose only `Field / Value type / Grouping / Data range`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8423
#: 77c1a9f65fbb49799ee26a7229fdbfcd
msgid "`选择方式 / 分箱数 / 辅助曲线 / 向量模长` 收入“高级选项”。"
msgstr ""
"`Selection mode / Bin count / Auxiliary curve / Vector magnitude` are "
"under Advanced options."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8424
#: c062a1229efb4a6f83eda3fd5ef3954c
#
msgid "`指标 / 数据系列` 与分布图联动；点击分箱会把对应结构选回 `NEP 数据集查看`。"
msgstr "`Metric / Series` are linked to the distribution plot; clicking a bin selects the corresponding structures back in `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8425
#: 1ba59fe83a9a4f19b4f7ec827d676b36
msgid "`参考值 / 预测值 / 误差` 只有在数据中确实存在对应标签或预测时才有结果。"
msgstr "`Reference / Prediction / Error` produce results only when the data actually contains the corresponding labels or predictions."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:15
#: 2962690047dd423d921df4b63aca2f0c
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-distributions.md:17
#: cc7c4b89cc224beaabe5e34fb17b8a4b
msgid ""
"确认当前字段是否真的提供 Reference、Prediction 或 Error。点击分箱后检查回写的结构数量； "
"分布只描述当前活动数据，已经删除的结构不在统计范围内。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the current field actually provides Reference, Prediction, "
"or Error. After clicking a bin, check the number of structures selected "
"back in Dataset Display. The distribution covers only active data; "
"deleted structures are excluded."

#~ msgid "Reference / Prediction / Error 只在底层数据支持时产生有效结果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Reference, Prediction, and Error produce "
#~ "valid results only when the underlying"
#~ " data provides them."
